  "description": "Wedding Leaf is a refined and romantic decorative font that blends timeless elegance with nature-inspired charm.\nEach uppercase letter is beautifully enclosed within a delicate hand-drawn wreath of leaves, creating a graceful monogram style that feels both classic and organic. This font is designed to add sophistication and warmth to your most special occasions.\nPerfect for wedding invitations, save-the-dates, bridal shower decor, elegant stationery, logos, or boutique branding, Wedding Leaf makes every project feel personal and polished. The ornamental leaf motif surrounding each letter brings a sense of harmony and calm—ideal for minimalist yet luxurious designs.\nWhile it focuses on uppercase characters, the clarity and style of each glyph make Wedding Leaf a versatile font for initial-based branding, custom tags, gift packaging, and event signage where a touch of botanical beauty is desired.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong><em>Wedding Leaf</em> is a refined and romantic decorative font that blends timeless elegance with nature-inspired charm.</strong></p>\n<p>Each uppercase letter is beautifully enclosed within a delicate hand-drawn wreath of leaves, creating a graceful monogram style that feels both classic and organic. This font is designed to add sophistication and warmth to your most special occasions.</p>\n<p>Perfect for wedding invitations, save-the-dates, bridal shower decor, elegant stationery, logos, or boutique branding, <em>Wedding Leaf</em> makes every project feel personal and polished. The ornamental leaf motif surrounding each letter brings a sense of harmony and calm—ideal for minimalist yet luxurious designs.</p>\n<p>While it focuses on uppercase characters, the clarity and style of each glyph make <em>Wedding Leaf</em> a versatile font for initial-based branding, custom tags, gift packaging, and event signage where a touch of botanical beauty is desired.</p>",
